      #|  !f:real^M->real^N s t.\n        f continuous_on s /\\ IMAGE f s = t /\\ compact s\n        ==> !u. closed_in (subtopology euclidean s) u\n                ==> closed_in (subtopology euclidean t) (IMAGE f u)
